    Gmail -- users.watch --> PubSub
    PubSub -- push, OIDC --> Ingestor
    Ingestor -- fetch message --> Gmail
    Ingestor -- upload PDF --> GCSRaw
    GCSRaw -- object finalized --> Eventarc
    Eventarc -- trigger, OIDC --> Agent
    Agent -- read PDF --> GCSRaw
    Agent -- multimodal calls --> Vertex
    Agent -- inventory query,<br/>run state --> Firestore
    Agent -- open PR --> GitHub
    Agent -- upload ECO PDF --> GCSEco

